  "request": "Read-only image preview with zoom and multiple formats; user screenshot is requirement material only, not a test input.",
  "implementation": [
    "Dispatch known image suffixes before text decoding. EditorWorkspace owns independent ImagePreviewDocument sessions; images have no text buffer, undo, autosave or language edits.",
    "Bounded anchored ordinary-file reads and ImageIO/resvg decoding run on a shared serial utility actor. Immutable eagerly decoded CGImage pixels cross to UI.",
    "Only active image retains pixels. Inactive tabs retain native zoom/pan state; close, switch and reload cancel and invalidate obsolete results; workspace access lives until the in-flight call returns.",
    "Default fit without enlarging small images; zoom presets, actual size, pointer-anchored pinch or modified wheel, drag/normal scroll/arrow pan, background choices and source metadata.",
    "Image menu uses Command = / - and Option Command 0 / 1, preserving existing Command 0 / 1 tool shortcuts.",
    "Fixed viewport drawing canvas avoids allocating a backing image for the entire zoomed scroll extent. External transparent scrollers have reserved lanes and no native junction square.",
    "SVG additive ABI 1 borrows UTF-8 and returns premultiplied RGBA8/error with paired buffer release; panic does not unwind across FFI."
  ],
  "format_samples": {
    "generated_and_decoded": [
      "PNG",
