    "svg_fixture": "Self-authored rectangle, intrinsic aspect, premultiplied alpha, malformed/external content and complexity failures",
    "conditional_unverified": "APNG, PSD, TGA, EXR, HDR, PNM, DDS, KTX, JPEG XL, camera RAW and remaining routed suffixes depend on runtime ImageIO; suffix dispatch is not a decoder support claim.",
    "multiple_frames": "First frame only; no animation or page navigation. ICO/ICNS select largest valid representation among at most 128 entries.",
    "svg_scope": "Local shapes/paths/text rasterized to longest edge 2048. Rejects script, foreignObject, image, use, filter, mask, pattern, clipPath, marker, tref and external href; SVGZ unsupported. Fixed raster zoom is not lossless vector rerendering."
